1","t":"And We placed within the earth firmly set mountains, lest it should shift with them, and We made therein [mountain] passes [as] roads that they might be guided.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":31,"sd":null},{"k":"21:32","t":"And We made the sky a protected ceiling, but they, from its signs, are turning away.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":32,"sd":null},{"k":"21:33","t":"And it is He who created the night and the day and the sun and the moon; all [heavenly bodies] in an orbit are swimming.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":33,"sd":null},{"k":"21:34","t":"And We did not grant to any man before you eternity [on earth]; so if you die - would they be eternal?","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":34,"sd":null},{"k":"21:35","t":"Every soul will taste death. And We test you with evil and with good as trial; and to Us you will be returned.","j":17,"h":33,"s":21,"a":35,"sd":null}],"juz":17,"hizb":33,"surahs":[21],"sajdah":false}